{"text": "G Tobacco Company\n\nOctober 3, 1994\n\nWinston-Salem, NC. 27102\n119.741 5000\n\nDr. Larry H. Gains\nLorillard Research Center\nP.O. Box 21688\nGreensboro, NC 27420-1688\n\nDear Larry:\n\nI'd like to thank you forall your hard work in organizing the 48th TCRC. Although this\ncertainly wasn\u2019t a one-person job, you were always in position to pull it all together when it\nlooked like it might be coming apart.\nAll of the local arrangements were first class! The facilities were exceptional, the\norganization was superb and I believe the 48th Tobacco Chemists\u2019 Research Conference is now\nthe standard by which all others will be compared. If you have the opportunity, please extend\niy gratitude to your entire staff.\nI certainly enjoyed working with you and I sincerely hope we have the opportunity to\n\u2018work together again in the future. Thanks again, both on behalf of the Program Editorial\n\u2018Committee and as a tobacco chemist.\n\nSincerely,\nMichael W. Ogden, Ph.D.\nChairman, 48th TCRC Program\nEditorial Committee\n\nxe: Dr. Jack Reid\n\n\u201cWe work for smokers.\u201d\n\n6Tteeceg", "words": [{"text": "G", "x0": 174, "y0": 112, "x1": 192, "y1": 165, "conf": 9.0}, {"text": "Tobacco", "x0": 214, "y0": 153, "x1": 255, "y1": 162, "conf": 14.0}, {"text": "Company", "x0": 258, "y0": 149, "x1": 307, "y1": 164, "conf": 91.0}, {"text": "October", "x0": 119, "y0": 230, "x1": 162, "y1": 240, "conf": 92.0}, {"text": "3,", "x0": 166, "y0": 230, "x1": 175, "y1": 242, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "1994", "x0": 181, "y0": 230, "x1": 205, "y1": 240, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "Winston-Salem,", "x0": 548, "y0": 191, "x1": 618, "y1": 200, "conf": 16.0}, {"text": "NC.", "x0": 621, "y0": 191, "x1": 637, "y1": 199, "conf": 16.0}, {"text": "27102", "x0": 642, "y0": 191, "x1": 667, "y1": 199, "conf": 76.0}, {"text": "119.741", "x0": 548, "y0": 203, "x1": 580, "y1": 210, "conf": 36.0}, {"text": "5000", "x0": 584, "y0": 203, "x1": 605, "y1": 210, "conf": 36.0}, {"text": "Dr